WEBVTT

00:02:59.636 --> 00:03:03.854
you would not be contributing
that extra labor.

00:03:03.878 --> 00:03:09.590
JL: Well, I was prepared and willing to go

00:03:09.614 --> 00:03:14.841
to try to do what my folks
called "doing better,"

00:03:14.865 --> 00:03:16.940
to get an education.

00:03:16.964 --> 00:03:20.009
But in the beginning,
I wanted to attend Troy State.

00:03:20.033 --> 00:03:22.960
BS: You wanted to desegregate Troy State.

00:03:22.984 --> 00:03:25.747
JL: I submitted my application,
my high school transcript.

00:03:25.771 --> 00:03:27.738
I never heard a word from the school.

00:03:28.142 --> 00:03:31.017
So I wrote a letter to Dr. King.